{"metadata":{"title":[{"Plain":"群化"},2],"tag":[{"Plain":"百科"},3],"slug":[{"Plain":"群化"},0],"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2>定义</h2>\n<p>群化是幺半群"},{"Local":{"url":"自由-遗忘伴随","text":"自由"}},{"Plain":"生成的群, 即群到幺半群的"},{"Local":{"url":"自由-遗忘伴随","text":"遗忘"}},{"Plain":"函子的左"},{"Local":{"url":"伴随","text":"伴随"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n"}]}}